Error [E0003]: Expected a statement, found `while`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_while.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     while c {
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: This position accepts only Jet's current statement grammar; retired foreign loop words are not statement keywords
 Fix: Write `loop condition { … }`; for repeated input, use `loop line in io.stdin().lines()` and stop in the body with `if test { break }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003

